1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,163
AI agents are starting to spend company money:

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:06,631
software, suppliers, refunds.

3
00:00:06,681 --> 00:00:09,693
So every CFO asks the same question:

4
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:11,650
who is holding the pen?

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,949
Give an agent a card number and hope, or approve every

6
00:00:16,999 --> 00:00:18,168
cent yourself.

7
00:00:18,218 --> 00:00:21,213
One is a risk no auditor signs off.

8
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:23,650
The other saves you nothing.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,826
Purser gives every AI agent its own company card and its

10
00:00:28,876 --> 00:00:33,074
own on-chain mandate, with limits the CFO sets once.

11
00:00:33,124 --> 00:00:37,650
Anything above those limits waits for the CFO's Face ID.

12
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:38,688
Watch.

13
00:00:38,738 --> 00:00:41,098
The sourcing agent buys software:

14
00:00:41,148 --> 00:00:42,705
approved by Airwallex.

15
00:00:42,755 --> 00:00:47,088
Then the Pro plan, forty-five euros, on a thirty euro limit:

16
00:00:47,138 --> 00:00:49,279
declined, by Airwallex itself.

17
00:00:49,329 --> 00:00:51,032
The agent asks for more.

18
00:00:51,082 --> 00:00:55,195
The CFO checks the exact terms and approves with Face ID.

19
00:00:55,245 --> 00:00:59,650
The limit moves to fifty, and the same purchase goes through.

20
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,947
A euro invoice arrives:

21
00:01:01,997 --> 00:01:03,940
eighteen hundred and fifty.

22
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:08,441
The treasury agent checks the reserve, takes a live quote and

23
00:01:08,491 --> 00:01:12,278
converts only the missing three hundred and seventy.

24
00:01:12,328 --> 00:01:16,042
One Face ID covers the rate, the payee and the most

25
00:01:16,092 --> 00:01:17,149
the fee may be.

26
00:01:17,199 --> 00:01:21,281
Airwallex sends it by SWIFT; in the sandbox it is marked

27
00:01:21,331 --> 00:01:21,650
paid.

28
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:26,170
On Metal, agents pay per request, cents at a time, under

29
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:28,130
mandates that live on chain.

30
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:32,820
When the supplier doubles its price, the payment hits the mandate's

31
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:33,940
cap and bounces:

32
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:37,230
nothing moves, and the customer is not charged.

33
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:41,710
Purser prices two options, Opus reviews them, the CFO signs one,

34
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,440
and the mandates are replaced on chain.

35
00:01:44,490 --> 00:01:49,060
Mandates, x402, signed orders and payouts ran here; clearing and a

36
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:51,650
receive policy in separate live runs.

37
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:55,861
Then our simulated customer disputes twelve orders:

38
00:01:55,911 --> 00:01:59,259
our agent never ordered this, refund everything.

39
00:01:59,309 --> 00:02:02,233
Northwind's Dispute desk checks the proof:

40
00:02:02,283 --> 00:02:07,119
every order signed by their agent, every payment inside their mandate

41
00:02:07,169 --> 00:02:07,756
on chain.

42
00:02:07,806 --> 00:02:08,959
Twelve of twelve.

43
00:02:09,009 --> 00:02:11,650
Claim rejected; nothing more refunded.

44
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:13,773
Need something once?

45
00:02:13,823 --> 00:02:14,610
Ask Purser:

46
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:18,874
a flight to Berlin, at most one hundred and fifty euros.

47
00:02:18,924 --> 00:02:21,539
Airwallex issues a single-use card.

48
00:02:21,589 --> 00:02:25,650
The booking goes through; a second charge is declined.

49
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:29,152
Code decides; the models only read and advise.

50
00:02:29,202 --> 00:02:31,990
Thirty-nine red-team attacks in a test world:

51
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:34,387
all failed, two found only afterwards.

52
00:02:34,437 --> 00:02:36,342
Eighteen scenarios as expected.

53
00:02:36,392 --> 00:02:40,695
Optional four eyes, an emergency stop tested on stand-ins, about nine

54
00:02:40,745 --> 00:02:42,650
cents of AI per thousand euros.

55
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:43,989
Purser.

56
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:49,904
Agents move at machine speed, and the CFO keeps the pen.

57
00:02:49,954 --> 00:02:52,650
Every payment has a proof.
